# Build & release

## Daily dev

```bash
cd blitz-extension
npm run dev          # watch popup
npm run build        # production popup → popup/dist/
npm run validate     # required files exist
```

Reload extension after popup or manifest/background/content changes.

## Store package

```bash
npm run pack         # build + validate + dist/blitz-extension-vX.zip
```

Zip uses `archiver` in `scripts/zip-extension.mjs` (not PowerShell — Windows-safe).

## Versioning

`npm run version:patch|minor|major` updates **both** `package.json` and `manifest.json`.

`npm run changelog:add -- "Description"` prepends to `CHANGELOG.md`.

## Required artifacts

- `popup/dist/index.html` (after build)
- `offscreen/jspdf.umd.min.js` (`npm run copy:jspdf` / postinstall)
- `assets/icon*.png` (`npm run icons`)

## CSP

Never add CDN hosts to `manifest.json` `content_security_policy`. Bundle vendor JS under `offscreen/`.
